    <item>
      <title>Hammerspoon 2 0.0.17</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:48:07 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1297</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.17</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/releases/tag/0.0.17</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2 dir="auto">Added</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">HSMenuBarItem.titleColor</code>, to colour a menu bar item's title (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6012809659" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/354" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/354/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/354">#354</a>)</li>
<li>A <code class="notranslate">color</code> key for <code class="notranslate">hs.menubar</code> and <code class="notranslate">hs.dockicon</code> menu entries, to colour their titles (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6012809659" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/354" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/354/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/354">#354</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.bluetooth</code>, for listing paired and connected Bluetooth devices, their battery levels, connecting and disconnecting them, scanning for nearby devices, reading and writing Bluetooth LE characteristics, and watching for connections and Bluetooth being turned on or off (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6014952081" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/357" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/357/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/357">#357</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.permissions.checkBluetooth()</code> and <code class="notranslate">hs.permissions.requestBluetooth()</code> (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6014952081" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/357" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/357/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/357">#357</a>)</li>
<li>Hammerspoon 2 can now request access to calendars and reminders, so scripts can read them via EventKit (e.g. JXA in <code class="notranslate">hs.osascript</code>, or tools run with <code class="notranslate">hs.task</code>) (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6055692701" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/362" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/362/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/362">#362</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">HSUIWindow.behavior()</code> and <code class="notranslate">HSUIWindow.behaviorList()</code>, to make a window appear on every Space or over fullscreen apps (e.g. <code class="notranslate">behaviorList(["canJoinAllSpaces", "fullScreenAuxiliary"])</code>) (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6062198165" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/364" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/364/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/364">#364</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.chooser</code> now supports Page Up / Page Down (or Fn-↑ / Fn-↓) to move through results a page at a time, and Home / End (or Fn-← / Fn-→) to jump to the first / last result (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6101944300" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/369" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/369/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/369">#369</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.wifi.configuration()</code> and <code class="notranslate">hs.wifi.cachedScanResults()</code>, which return the configuration and cached scan results that used to be part of <code class="notranslate">hs.wifi.interfaceDetails()</code> (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6117151280" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/370" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/370/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/370">#370</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.spoons.use()</code>, which installs a Spoon from a GitHub repository or zip URL if it isn't installed, then loads and configures it, like v1's SpoonInstall (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6168227264" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/372" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/372/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/372">#372</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.spoons.install()</code>, <code class="notranslate">hs.spoons.update()</code>, <code class="notranslate">hs.spoons.uninstall()</code>, <code class="notranslate">hs.spoons.available()</code> and <code class="notranslate">hs.spoons.installed()</code>, for managing Spoons from GitHub repositories or zip URLs (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6168227264" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/372" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/372/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/372">#372</a>)</li>
<li>An "Install Spoons when opened" setting in the Advanced settings tab that turns off automatic installation of double-clicked <code class="notranslate">.spoon2</code> bundles (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6172358009" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/373" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/373/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/373">#373</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.chooser</code> choices can opt out of the context menu with <code class="notranslate">contextMenu: false</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.socket</code>, for communicating over raw TCP, UDP and Unix domain sockets</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">HSSocket.enableServerTLS()</code> and <code class="notranslate">HSSocket.enableServerTLSFromKeychain()</code>, which make a listening socket use TLS with a certificate from a PKCS#12 file or the keychain</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">HSSocket.listen()</code> and <code class="notranslate">HSUDPSocket.bind()</code> take an optional local IP address, to accept connections or datagrams on just that address</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">HSSocket.state</code>, <code class="notranslate">HSSocket.connectTimeout</code> and <code class="notranslate">HSSocket.readTimeout</code>, and an optional <code class="notranslate">lossy</code> argument to <code class="notranslate">hs.socket.decodeText()</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.mqtt</code>, an MQTT client for publishing and subscribing to brokers</li>
<li>Hammerspoon 2 offers to report a crash as a GitHub issue the next time it launches</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="auto">Changed</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">HSUIWindow.level()</code> and <code class="notranslate">HSUIWindow.windowTitle()</code> now update a window that's already shown (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6062198165" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/364" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/364/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/364">#364</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.wifi.interfaceDetails()</code> no longer includes <code class="notranslate">configuration</code> or <code class="notranslate">cachedScanResults</code>, because fetching them leaks memory inside macOS. Use <code class="notranslate">hs.wifi.configuration()</code> and <code class="notranslate">hs.wifi.cachedScanResults()</code> instead (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6117151280" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/370" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/370/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/370">#370</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.loadSpoon()</code> is now <code class="notranslate">hs.spoons.load()</code>, and its errors have a <code class="notranslate">code</code> (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6168227264" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/372" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/372/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/372">#372</a>)</li>
<li>Console results are now formatted like <code class="notranslate">console.log()</code> output (e.g. booleans print as <code class="notranslate">true</code>/<code class="notranslate">false</code>, objects as <code class="notranslate">{ a: 1 }</code>) (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6247770127" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/378" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/378/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/378">#378</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.chooser</code> context menus are now set once for the whole chooser with <code class="notranslate">contextMenu</code>, and report the picked entry and row to a single <code class="notranslate">onContextMenuSelect</code> callback, instead of each choice having its own <code class="notranslate">contextMenu</code> with an <code class="notranslate">action</code> per entry</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="auto">Fixed</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">HSWindow.isFocused</code> now returns true for the focused window (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6028560648" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/358" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/358/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/358">#358</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">console.log()</code> of Hammerspoon objects (e.g. an <code class="notranslate">HSApplication</code>) printed <code class="notranslate">undefined {}</code> instead of a description of the object (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6050674666" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/359" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/359/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/359">#359</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.window:focus()</code> now keeps the requested window in front in applications such as Google Chrome that bring their previous window back after activating (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6050769659" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/361" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/361/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/361">#361</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">HSCanvas.behaviorList()</code> and <code class="notranslate">HSCanvas.behaviorValue()</code> no longer crash Hammerspoon when given mutually exclusive behaviors (e.g. <code class="notranslate">canJoinAllSpaces</code> with <code class="notranslate">moveToActiveSpace</code>) or a negative bitmask; they throw an Error instead (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6062198165" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/364" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/364/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/364">#364</a>)</li>
<li>Reloading the configuration no longer leaks the previous JavaScript environment's memory if <code class="notranslate">fetch()</code> was used (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6090121193" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/366" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/366/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/366">#366</a>)</li>
<li>Polling <code class="notranslate">hs.wifi.interfaceDetails()</code> no longer makes Hammerspoon's memory use grow steadily (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6117151280" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/370" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/370/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/370">#370</a>)</li>
<li>Errors in Promises that nothing handles, such as a Spoon that fails to load in <code class="notranslate">hs.spoons.use()</code>, are now logged to the Console instead of disappearing (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6168227264" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/372" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/372/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/372">#372</a>)</li>
<li>Hammerspoon could freeze when updating an <code class="notranslate">hs.chooser</code>'s choices while its callbacks were being garbage collected (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6245463572" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/376" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/376/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/376">#376</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.timer.doAt()</code> now repeats at <code class="notranslate">repeatInterval</code> instead of only firing once</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/compare/0.0.16...0.0.17"><tt>0.0.16...0.0.17</tt></a></p>]]></description>
